      "audio": {
        "noise": "excavator",
        "snr_db": 10
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "08:15. The rebar drawings for axis C, revision b, came in by email from Ingenieurbüro Brandl at 08:10. The Müller crew starts on axis C at 08:30. The base slab pour stays planned for Wednesday, 26.11."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-04",
      "time": "09:35",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-03"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "excavator",
        "snr_db": 5
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "09:35. The excavator has been standing since 09:30 on the north side of BA1. The shoring at axis 4 by Spezialtiefbau Maier isn't finished, 2 bays are still missing, and without shoring we're not allowed to dig deeper. 3 earthworks guys are waiting, the operator too. Maier says they won't come until after lunch."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-05",
      "time": "09:37",
      "modality": "photo",
      "events": [
        "EVT-03"
      ],
      "scene_en": "Edge of an excavation pit: a parked excavator with lowered bucket, engine off. Next to it a soldier-pile wall where two bays have no timber lagging, exposed soil visible. Three workers in hi-vis vests stand waiting with hands in pockets, faces turned away.",
      "vlm_visible": [
        "Bagger steht",
        "Verbau mit Lücken",
        "Arbeiter warten"
      ],
      "not_visible": [
        "wer den Verbau ausführt und wer ihn beauftragt hat",
        "seit 09:30",
        "Vorgang A20"
      ],
      "exif": {
        "datetime": "2026-11-23T09:37:00+01:00",
        "gps": [
          48.13071,
          11.69523
        ]
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Axis 4 north side: shoring with 2 open bays, excavator idle."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-06",
      "time": "09:50",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "NM-01"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "clean",
        "snr_db": null
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Had another look at the excavator, the hydraulics are tight, the new hose from Friday is holding. The machine itself is fine."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-07",
      "time": "10:05",
      "modality": "text",
      "events": [
        "EVT-04"
      ],
      "language": "en",
      "text": "10:05 support chairs + spacers axis C not here (window 9–10). Stahlhandel Süd: arriving 11:00. Müller carrying on with bottom layer, 2 men waiting approx. 1 h."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-08",
      "time": "10:50",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-05"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "vibrator",
        "snr_db": 10
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "10:50. On the base slab edge formwork at axis D we built in an offset of 2 centimetres, the string line had slipped, our mistake. We're taking down 3 metres and resetting them, that'll take about 1.5 hours."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-09",
      "time": "10:52",
      "modality": "photo",
      "events": [
        "EVT-05"
      ],
      "scene_en": "Close-up of timber edge formwork of a ground slab with a taut string line; one board visibly sits out of line with the others, a yellow folding rule laid across for scale.",
      "vlm_visible": [
        "Schalung nicht in der Flucht",
        "Zollstock als Maßstab"
      ],
      "not_visible": [
        "eigene Leistung (nicht Vorleistung)",
        "Maß 2 cm genau"
      ],
      "exif": {
        "datetime": "2026-11-23T10:52:00+01:00",
        "gps": [
          48.13048,
          11.6956
        ]
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Edge formwork axis D, board approx. 2 cm out of line."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-10",
      "time": "11:45",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-06"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "clean",
        "snr_db": null
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "11:45. Mr Wagner, the client's authorised representative, emailed at 11:40: because of the new plant room, the base slab between axis A and B goes from 25 to 30 centimetres, area roughly 140 square metres. The revised rebar drawings will come by Tuesday. He wants us to take that into account for the pour on 26.11. I reckon that's a good 7 cubic metres more concrete."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-11",
      "time": "12:10",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-07"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "clean",
        "snr_db": null
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "12:10. About the core drillings from Friday: architect Lechner called asking when we're drilling. But there's still no confirmation of the costs from the client. We're not starting them yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-12",
      "time": "14:05",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-03"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "excavator",
        "snr_db": 0
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "14:05. Maier has finished the 2 bays at axis 4, the excavator's been running again since 14:00."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-13",
      "time": "14:20",
      "modality": "photo",
      "events": [
        "EVT-08"
      ],
      "scene_en": "View into the excavation at a slab edge: a steel waler of the soldier-pile shoring wall protrudes clearly past the inner face of the edge formwork into the future slab area; a folding rule measures the overlap. Lean concrete blinding layer visible.",
      "vlm_visible": [
        "Bauteil ragt in den Bodenplattenbereich",
        "Zollstock als Maßstab"
      ],
      "not_visible": [
        "Bauteil gehört zum Verbau von MAIER",
        "Maß 8 cm",
        "Folge für die Bodenplatte"
      ],
      "exif": {
        "datetime": "2026-11-23T14:20:00+01:00",
        "gps": [
          48.13045,
          11.69566
        ]
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Axis D: shoring waler projects approx. 8 cm into the base slab."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-14",
      "time": "14:22",
      "modality": "voice",
      "events": [
        "EVT-08"
      ],
      "audio": {
        "noise": "wind",
        "snr_db": 5
      },
      "language": "en",
      "text": "14:22. At axis D the waler of Maier's shoring sticks about 8 centimetres into the base slab. We can't build the slab there at full thickness like that, the rebar clashes. We're carrying on with the other axes, axis D stays open until it's clear how this gets solved."
