      "text": "16:35. Output for 23 November: excavation BA1 about 150 cubic metres, the excavator was down from 09:30 to 14:00. Base slab rebar 7.2 tonnes, axis C from 08:30. Edge formwork axis D 21 metres, of which 3 metres reset. Pour 0, stays on 26.11. Core drillings not started."
